<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BES cuts prime rate to 10.875 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BES cuts prime rate to 10.875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Espirito Santo said it had decided to cut its variable prime rate by 0.375 percentage points to 10.875 percent effective January 2.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
